      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organizational Page Visitor Of The Day",
      "Anchor": "organizational-page-visitor-of-the-day",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Organizational Page Visitor Of The Day Digital Markets Act (DMA) API returns the Visitor Of The Day data for an Organizational Page.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organizational Page Visitor Of The Day",
      "Anchor": "organizational-page-visitor-of-the-day",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The API currently provides a method to find an Organizational Page\u2019s visitor of the day by an Organizational Page\u2019s OrganizationalPageUrn.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Feature Overview",
      "Anchor": "feature-overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "The Visitor of the Day (VOTD) feature selects one page viewer per day for your organization\u0027s LinkedIn page. The API returns a historical list of these daily selections. Organizations with a premium company pages subscription receive unobfuscated visitor data (including the visitor\u0027s Person URN). Organizations without a premium subscription receive obfuscated visitor data (visitor identity is withheld).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Key details",
      "Anchor": "key-details",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Feature Overview",
        "Key details"
      ],
      "Text": "Each record includes the visitor\u0027s identity (as a Person URN if the page is premium) and how many days ago they were selected.\nThis feature is not available for Showcase pages. It only applies to Organizational pages.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
